<title>UK: Ldn gold fixed higher, stirred by weak dollar.</title>
<headline>Ldn gold fixed higher, stirred by weak dollar.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed higher at $344.80 from $343.75 on Thursday afternoon. Weak dollar against yen stirs precious metals higher, but $345.00 resistance seen difficult to overcome.</p>
<p>SILVER - Builds on Thursday's strength. Up one cent at $4.84/$4.86. Immediate resistance placed at $4.85.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Gains $6.50 to $382.50/$383.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Spikes to new two-year high of $162.50, up $4.10.</p>
</text>
